# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# Cross-origin isolation is what lets ONNX Runtime Web use threaded WASM. Without it ORT
# falls back to a single thread and the encoder takes several times longer.
#
# credentialless rather than require-corp: both unlock threads, but require-corp would need
# a CORP header on the weights from Hugging Face, which is not ours to add.
#
# Comments must sit outside the rule block. Indented ones inside it are parsed as headers,
# which risks the whole block being discarded, and losing the block loses the threads.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
